#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:6
msgid "$copy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:8
msgid "Usage: **$copy(target,source)**"
msgstr "用法：**$copy(target,source)**"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:9
msgid "Category: assignment"
msgstr "类别：赋值"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:10
msgid "Implemented: Picard 0.9"
msgstr "实现：Picard 0.9"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:12
msgid "**Description:**"
msgstr "**描述：**"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:14
msgid "Copies metadata from variable ``source`` to ``target``. The difference from ``$set(target,%source%)`` is that ``$copy(target,source)`` copies multi-value variables without flattening them."
msgstr ""
"将变量 ``source`` 中的元数据复制到 ``target``。与 ``$set(target,%source%)`` "
"的区别在于 ``$copy(target,source)`` 复制多值变量时不将其扁平化。"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:18
msgid "Unlike most functions, in this case the ``source`` is specified **without** enclosing it with percent signs (%)."
msgstr "与大多数函数不同，在这种情况下，``source`` 是**不**用百分号 (%) 括起来的。"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:22
msgid "If the variable ``target`` already exists, it will be overwritten by ``source``."
msgstr "如果变量 ``target`` 已存在，它将被 ``source`` 覆盖。"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:24
msgid "**Example:**"
msgstr "**示例：**"

#: ../../functions/func_copy.rst:26
msgid "The following statements will yield the values for ``target`` as indicated:"
msgstr "以下语句将产生 ``target`` 指示的值："
